          <div class="testimonial__author">Kavitha R.</div>
          <div class="testimonial__condition">Hypothyroidism Patient</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
        <div class="testimonial__stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial__text">Very knowledgeable about diabetes and hormonal conditions. My HbA1c is now under control after months of struggle.</p>
        <div>
          <div class="testimonial__author">Mohammed A.</div>
          <div class="testimonial__condition">Diabetes &amp; Obesity Patient</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── BLOG PREVIEW ─── -->
<section class="section blog-preview" aria-labelledby="blog-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__label reveal">Health Resources</p>
    <h2 class="section__heading reveal" id="blog-heading">From Dr. Purwar's Desk</h2>
    <p class="section__sub reveal">Evidence-based articles on endocrine health — written to help you understand your condition and make informed decisions.</p>

    {% set recentPosts = collections.posts | limit(3) %}
    {% if recentPosts.length %}
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in recentPosts %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card reveal">
        {% if post.data.cover %}
        <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" class="blog-card__img" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy" />
        {% else %}
        <div class="blog-card__img-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="blog-card__body">
          {% if post.data.category %}<div class="blog-card__category">{{ post.data.category }}</div>{% endif %}
          <div class="blog-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</div>
          {% if post.data.summary %}
          <div class="blog-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="blog-card__excerpt">{{ post.templateContent | excerpt }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="blog-card__meta">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }} · Dr. Naincy Purwar</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;">
      <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn--ghost">View All Articles →</a>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="blog-empty reveal">
      <div class="blog-empty__title">Articles Coming Soon</div>
      <p class="blog-empty__sub">Dr. Purwar will be sharing expert insights on Diabetes, Thyroid, PCOS, and hormonal health. Follow <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" style="color:var(--primary);">{{ site.instagramHandle }}</a> for updates.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── FAQ ─── -->
<section class="section section--alt" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container--default">
    <p class="section__label reveal text-center">Common Questions</p>
    <h2 class="section__heading reveal text-center" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          How do I book an online consultation?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">Use the calendar above to pick your preferred date and time. Fill in your details and your booking is confirmed instantly. You'll receive a confirmation email with the video call link.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          What is the consultation fee?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">The tele-consultation fee is ₹700. In-person consultation fees may vary by location. Call us at {{ site.phoneDisplay }} to confirm.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          What should I share for my consultation?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">Please have your previous prescriptions, blood test reports (HbA1c, thyroid panel, lipid profile, etc.), and a list of current medications ready. Share these as photos or PDFs via WhatsApp before your appointment.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          Does Dr. Purwar see paediatric (child) patients?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">Yes, Dr. Purwar specialises in paediatric endocrine conditions including diabetes in children, short stature, growth hormone deficiency, early/delayed puberty, and paediatric thyroid disorders.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          What platforms are used for video consultation?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">We use WhatsApp Video Call or Google Meet — whichever is more convenient for you. The link is shared at the time of booking confirmation.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          Can I get a prescription online?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">Yes, for follow-up consultations and stable patients, Dr. Purwar can issue a digital prescription after the online video consultation. New patients may be asked to visit in person for a complete evaluation.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          Does Dr. Purwar write health articles?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">Yes! Dr. Purwar regularly writes evidence-based articles on endocrine health topics — diabetes management, thyroid care, PCOS, and more. Visit the <a href="/blog/" style="color:var(--primary);">Blog</a> section or follow <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" style="color:var(--primary);">{{ site.instagramHandle }}</a> on Instagram for updates.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
